    "text": "Complex <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> have two G.I. which are optically inactive due to presence of plane of symmetry.<br />Complex <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></math> also have two optically inactive geometrical isomers due to presence of plane of symmetry.<br />complex <math> <mrow>  <mtext>trans-[Co</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"(\">   <mrow>    <msub>     <mrow>      <mtext>en)</mtext></mrow>     <mtext>2</mtext>    </msub>    <msub>     <mrow>      <mtext>Br</mtext></mrow>     <mtext>2</mtext>    </msub>    </mrow>  </mfenced><mtext>Br</mtext></mrow></math> is optically inactive.<br />Complex <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> is optically active due to formation of non-superimposable mirro